# Keep the build context small and free of secrets.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/.vitest
**/.expo
.git
.github
.husky
.claude
docs
infra
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.log

# The API image needs only the mobile manifest (the lockfile references it), not its sources.
apps/mobile/*
!apps/mobile/package.json
